,"duration":4.041667},"dba792ed33a8":{"text":"I would give it a happier ending.","id":"dba792ed33a8","source":"BTS 24 · #68","image":"/img/scene-clips/7433.webp","imageBytes":15366,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7433.mp4","videoBytes":90601,"duration":4.041667},"deecdf793157":{"text":"What if you were a dragon slayer?","id":"deecdf793157","source":"BTS 24 · #97","image":"/img/scene-clips/7434.webp","imageBytes":15408,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7434.mp4","videoBytes":112817,"duration":4.041667},"eb3a8c4a1ddc":{"text":"I would look for magical creatures.","id":"eb3a8c4a1ddc","source":"BTS 24 · #28","image":"/img/scene-clips/7462.webp","imageBytes":10332,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7462.mp4","videoBytes":82688,"duration":4.041667},"8f4a1e5fec67":{"text":"I would have a unicorn or a phoenix.","id":"8f4a1e5fec67","source":"BTS 24 · #34","image":"/img/scene-clips/7488.webp","imageBytes":23100,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7488.mp4","videoBytes":123919,"duration":4.041667},"11cac3a443ad":{"text":"That would be shocking but exciting.","id":"11cac3a443ad","source":"BTS 24 · #46","image":"/img/scene-clips/7489.webp","imageBytes":15558,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7489.mp4","videoBytes":123674,"duration":4.041667},"34ee1683fa0a":{"text":"What if you found a genie in a lamp?","id":"34ee1683fa0a","source":"BTS 24 · #89","image":"/img/scene-clips/7500.webp","imageBytes":8358,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7500.mp4","videoBytes":107006,"duration":4.041667}},"examples":["I would look for magical creatures.","I would choose the power to heal anyone.","I would choose to be invisible.","If I were a millionaire, I would travel the world.","What would you buy if you had a million dollars?","I would buy a big house for my family.","I would be an eagle and fly high.","I would visit ancient Egypt.","If I could fly, I would visit every country.","What if you could talk to animals?","That would be amazing! I would talk to my dog.","If I were a superhero, I would save everyone.","Imagine you could go anywhere in the world.","I would go to Paris to see the Eiffel Tower.","If you could meet anyone, who would it be?","I would meet my favorite scientist.","What would you do if you could stop time?","If you had a lightsaber, would you use it?","I would use the extra time to study and play.","If dragons were real, would you be scared?","I would try to communicate peacefully.","No, I would try to make friends with one!","Use your imagination to create something new.","If you could create a new fantasy world, describe it.","Anything is possible if you believe in yourself.","What if you could live in a castle?","I would love to have a castle with a moat.","If you had a magic wand, what would you do?","I would make everyone happy.","What if you could be any animal?","What if you discovered you were royalty?","If you discovered a magical forest, what would you explore?","I would explore places I cannot normally go.","What if you found a treasure map?","I would follow it to find buried treasure.","If you had a time machine, when would you go?","What if you could have any pet?","I would have a unicorn or a phoenix.","If you could have any fantasy creature as a friend, who?","The Lord of the Rings world would be amazing.","What if you were a wizard like Harry Potter?","I would learn all the magical spells.","If you could have a superpower, what would it be?","What if you could speak all languages?","I could travel anywhere and understand everyone.","If you could see into the future, would you want to?","Maybe, but knowing too much might be bad.","That would be shocking but exciting.","What if you were a dragon slayer?","I would have a dragon as my best friend.","What if you found a magical book?","I would read it immediately.","It would have floating islands and crystal towers.","What if you had infinite wishes?","I would wish for wisdom.","It would have magic, adventure, and peace.","If you could be a character from a story, who would you be?","I would be Hermione Granger.","What if you could visit Hogwarts School?","I would only use it for good purposes.","What if you were a superhero, what would be your name?","I would be called Captain Justice.","If you could have any magical item, what would it be?","A cloak of invisibility would be useful.","What if you discovered a parallel universe?","I would explore it carefully.","If you could rewrite any story, which would you choose?","I would give it a happier ending.","What if you found a genie in a lamp?","What if you had genie granting three wishes?","I would wish for happiness for everyone.","If you could live forever, would you want to?","Maybe, if I could stay young.","What if you could be invisible for a day?","If you had a magic mirror, what would you ask it?","I would transform into a bird and fly.","If you discovered a secret passage, where would it lead?","It would lead to a hidden treasure room.","What if you were chosen as the chosen one?","I would accept the responsibility.","If you could travel to space, where would you go?","I would visit distant galaxies.","What if aliens came to Earth?","I would build a theme park.","If you could control the elements, which would you choose?","I would control water and ice.","What if you could live in any fictional place?","I would choose Narnia.","If you could have any magical ability, what would it be?","Teleportation would be useful.","I would be very brave and strong."]}
